  "configuration_id": "config_004",
  "reason": "RNA-only PCA singleprofile is much stronger than image-only ResNet singleprofile in both accuracy and F1, so RNA is the promising modality. The key uncertainty is whether a learned RNA encoder improves over PCA. config_004 tests scvi_n200 with the same singleprofile setting and no aggregation, isolating the RNA representation choice. This is the best next use of budget because it is a clean one-variable comparison on the stronger modality, avoids assuming multiprofile or multimodal complexity will help, and will inform whether subsequent experiments should build on scvi or remain PCA-based."
}

